I was running an eighth level samurai and was buttering up my god. I offered him
all sorts of goodies and at one point he gave me a Katana named Snickersee. 
It appeared at my feet. I picked it up. (g) a Katana named Snickersee and 
proceeded to wield it. It's got to be better than my +1 katana, right?
Wrong!! The damned thing wielded itself to my hand and let directly to
my death in the next combat.

Even if the god dispenses cursed artifacts (which I think is a bug), picking
it up from the alter should at least identify it as cursed.

Perhaps this could be fixed in the next set of patches.

